    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Click the **+ buttons** on the blue shirt and red shirt. What happens? Is that what you expected?\r\n\r\n2. Open the debug panel by clicking the bug icon in the upper right corner above the Preview. What do you see?\r\n\r\n3. Open `prompt.md` and plan how to update `addShirt` so it shows the correct shirt.\r\n\r\n4. Give the function and your prompt to the AI as context to update the `addShirt` function.\r\n\r\n5. Test by clicking the shirt buttons. If the output doesn't change correctly, revise your prompt and try again.",
